hub.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100695","id":2603983757,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bNaON","user":{"login":"pafuent","id":6979945,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5Nzk5NDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6979945?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent","html_url":"https://github.com/pafuent","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pafuent/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-21T08:40:00Z","updated_at":"2025-01-21T08:40:00Z","body":"Thanks @KoBeWi for fixing it!!!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2603983757/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2645755492","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100695#issuecomment-2645755492","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100695","id":2645755492,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dswZk","user":{"login":"Rindbee","id":30386067,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzg2MDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30386067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee","html_url":"https://github.com/Rindbee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-08T14:58:16Z","updated_at":"2025-02-08T15:02:43Z","body":"This seems to be an issue with `ScrollContainer::ensure_control_visible()`.\n\nThe previous logic considered the case where the area of ​​the child control is **smaller** than the visible area of ​​the `ScrollContainer`, but did not consider the case where the area of ​​the child control is **larger** than the visible area of ​​the `ScrollContainer`.\n\n\nPerhaps a more reasonable logic is to make the visible area of ​​the child control as large as possible without losing the previous visible area.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c5a9d677-9a66-49fb-a617-20119179d995)\n\nThe black box is the visible area of ​​the **ScrollContainer**, the red box is the position of the child control before it is focused, and the green box is the position after being adjusted by `ensure_control_visible()`. \n\nIn cases B and C, it may still jump, but in case A, it should not jump.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2645755492/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]